WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.451
Welcome to Future Ready AI.

00:00:02.631 --> 00:00:09.004
Future Ready AI was created to help students and educators build the knowledge,

00:00:09.184 --> 00:00:14.086
confidence, and judgment needed to thrive in an AI-powered world.

00:00:14.266 --> 00:00:18.677
We believe AI education should be age-appropriate, responsible, creative,

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:20.328
and deeply human-centered.

00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:25.410
Students are not simply learning how to use new tools.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:30.492
They are learning how to think critically, ask better questions,

00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:34.103
evaluate information, protect their privacy, recognize bias,

00:00:34.283 --> 00:00:36.244
and make thoughtful decisions.

00:00:36.424 --> 00:00:42.797
Our goal is to prepare learners and educators to engage with artificial intelligence

00:00:42.977 --> 00:00:45.428
with confidence, curiosity, and integrity.

00:00:45.608 --> 00:00:51.000
At Future Ready AI, we are learning, creating, and leading together.
